design:
Integration shape:

```ts
const nonClassRules = [
  ...coreRules,
  ...spellcastingRules,
  ...gamemasteringRules,
];
// Existing table/race work remains here.
const classPages = sliceSection(pages, anchors.classes);
const classCalloutRules = parseClassCallouts(classPages);
const rules = [...nonClassRules, ...classCalloutRules];
validateRuleCoverage(rules, input.expectedRuleKeys);
```

`ruleExtractionsToRecords` already supplies `kind`, `source`, license, and page provenance, so no emitter or schema change is needed. Exact combined key coverage is the fail-closed guard for both missing boxes and accidental promotion of another h~10.8 artifact. Canonical assertions should use keys and provenance, not array positions.
